  "metadata": {
    "name": "trajectory-power-phase4-pilot-100x199",
    "phase": 4,
    "intent": "Phase 4 medium pilot: pooled PLS on M-value methylation, n=300, 4 stages, 100 replicates, 199 permutations, matched seeds with one shared zero-effect anchor, bounded orientation-attribution diagnostics, and a predeclared Phase 5 gate.",
    "supersedes": "examples/trajectory_power_study/pilot_50x199.json",
    "notes": [
      "Translation is a location-only offset at any effect, so every translation power-grid level is a Type I control alongside the `none` baseline.",
      "Orientation and shape off-diagonal responses are descriptive: Phase 2 showed both constructions are mixed after biological propagation and joint preprocessing.",
      "The shape gate constrains only the diagonal `shape` response; it tests detectability of the constructed bend, not shape-specific purity.",
      "Attribution eligibility is fixed at enumeration and never conditioned on an observed p-value."
    ]
  }
